        say Betakam presentation=text_only : "Commander how about teleporting his mummy, perhaps it would please him|..."
        say Betakam presentation=text_only : "What are you doing|? You're going to seriously traumatize the poor guy|!"
        say Betakam presentation=text_only if_not_shown skip_next=1 : "Betakam... We know your sun Gladis is going to explode and all your descendants will perish|..."
        request sequence "hboc.hnm"
        say Betakam presentation=text_only : "How amusing|... You realize of course that nobody can predict the future|!"
        say Betakam presentation=text_only if_not_shown skip_next=1 : "Oh yes they can|!!! Betakam|, we know the future|... That's where we come from|..."
